      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Spruce Knob, an arm of Blue Knob, the second‑highest mountain in Pennsylvania, rises to the south of Ski Gap, while Pine Knob towers 2,700 feet to the north.",
